<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Haemonetics.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Haemonetics.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday Haemonetics Corp was not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co and Westmoreland preferred A stock WCXpA.N were also unavailable, it said.</p>
<p>Haemonetics said it expected earnings per share for the third quarter ended December 1996 to be about 10 to 20 percent below the $0.32 reported for the same period last year.</p>
</text>
